# The ONLY thing on disk is a Doppler service token. Every real secret (IBKR creds,
# Anthropic key, EDGAR UA, SMTP, spend cap) lives in Doppler and is fetched at runtime
# by `doppler run` inside each container — see notes/deployment.md for the Doppler setup.
#
# Copy to deploy/.env, paste a read-only service token (scoped to the parley project +
# config), and `chmod 600 deploy/.env`. deploy/.env is gitignored.
DOPPLER_TOKEN=dp.st.xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional, non-secret: cron timezone (defaults to Asia/Singapore in compose).
# TZ=Asia/Singapore
